      "sentence": "Unified IskakINO ecosystem: fast GPIO, storage, LCD, WiFi portal, NTP, and DFPlayer voice control in one library.",
      "paragraph": "Penggabungan seluruh ekosistem IskakINO (ArduFast, Storage, LiquidCrystal_I2C, WifiPortal, FastNTP, SmartVoice) menjadi satu library dengan shared core. Modul universal (ArduFast, Storage, LCD, SmartVoice) bekerja di platform AVR, ESP32, dan ESP8266; modul WifiPortal dan FastNTP otomatis hanya aktif di board ESP32/ESP8266. Menggantikan library IskakINO_ArduFast, IskakINO_Storage, IskakINO_LiquidCrystal_I2C, IskakINO_WifiPortal, IskakINO_FastNTP, dan IskakINO_SmartVoice yang kini deprecated.",
